<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Sign in · StockChief</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/design.css?v=<%= typeof assetVersion==='undefined'?'auth':assetVersion %>">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/commercial.css?v=<%= typeof assetVersion==='undefined'?'auth':assetVersion %>"></head>
<body class="commercial-auth"><main class="auth-split"><section class="auth-form">
<a class="pub-brand" href="/"><span class="pub-brand__mark">◇</span><span>StockChief</span></a>
<div class="auth-form__body"><span class="pub-eyebrow">WELCOME BACK</span><h1>Sign in to your operation.</h1>
<p>StockChief runs your inventory operation—from reordering and receiving to transfers and shipping. You handle the exceptions that need your judgement.</p>
<% if(flash&&flash.length){ %><div class="auth-messages"><% flash.forEach(function(message){ %><div class="auth-message auth-message--<%= message.type %>" role="alert"><%= message.message %></div><% }); %></div><% } %>
<form method="post" action="/login" data-loading><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="next" value="<%= next %>">
<label class="auth-field"><span>Work email</span><input id="email" name="email" type="email" value="<%= email %>" required autocomplete="username" autofocus></label>
<label class="auth-field"><span>Password</span><span class="password-field"><input id="password" name="password" type="password" required autocomplete="current-password"><button type="button" data-password-toggle="password" aria-pressed="false">Show</button></span></label>
<div class="auth-between"><label title="Keeps this browser signed in for 30 days unless you sign out"><input type="checkbox" name="rememberMe" value="1"> Keep me signed in for 30 days</label><a href="/forgot-password">Forgot password?</a></div>
<button class="pub-btn pub-btn--block" type="submit" data-loading-label="Signing in…">Sign in</button></form>
<div class="auth-create"><span>New to StockChief?</span><a class="pub-btn pub-btn--secondary pub-btn--block" href="/register">Create account</a><p><a href="/demo">See it in action</a> or <a href="/pricing">compare plans</a>.</p></div></div></section>
<aside class="auth-visual"><div class="auth-visual__card"><span>EXAMPLE OPERATING DAY · SYNTHETIC RECORDS</span><h2>Four routine jobs handled.<br>One decision waiting.</h2>
<div><b>✓</b><p><strong>2 orders are shipping</strong><small>Labels prepared and tracking queued</small></p></div>
<div><b>✓</b><p><strong>Supplier delivery confirmed</strong><small>PO-1054 now expected Thursday</small></p></div>
<div><b>!</b><p><strong>Price change needs you</strong><small>Everything else is under control</small></p></div><p class="auth-help">This is an illustrative outcome. <a href="/demo">See the actual StockChief interface.</a></p></div></aside>
</main><script src="/commercial.js?v=<%= typeof assetVersion==='undefined'?'auth':assetVersion %>" defer></script></body></html>
